<title>MONACO: SOCCER-MONACO BEAT HAMBURG 3-0 IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MONACO BEAT HAMBURG 3-0 IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monaco of France led Hamburg of Germany 3-0 in their UEFA Cup third round first leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Sonny Anderson 48, Victor Ikpeba 70, Patrick Blondeau 76</p>
</text>
